               <title>Inactive ingredients</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>acesulfame potassium, aspartame, citric acid anhydrous, D&amp;C yellow no. 10, FD&amp;C blue no. 1, FD&amp;C red no. 40, flavors, maltodextrin, sodium citrate anhydrous, sucrose, and pregelatinized starch.</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20150421"/>
            </section>
         </component>
